<Base title="About Zachary Swanepoel | Local Presence 360"><section class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT / THE BUILDER</div><h1 class="page-title">I like making complex things useful.</h1><p class="lead">Developer, digital growth practitioner and relentlessly curious builder in Cape Town.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap feature"><div class="portrait"><img src={profile.photo} alt="Zachary Swanepoel"/></div><div><h2>More than one discipline.</h2><p>I'm Zachary Clint Swanepoel. My work brings together full-stack development, WordPress, search engine optimization, Google Ads, analytics and operational tooling.</p><p>I enjoy connecting what gets built with why it matters: a better customer experience, a clearer team process or a more useful way of measuring performance.</p><p>Alongside client work, I experiment with web games, AI-assisted development and tools for practical problems. This website doubles as my public learning journal.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/projects/">See my projects ↗</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div></div></section><section class="section alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">TOOLS & DISCIPLINES</div><h2>What I work with</h2><div class="chips">{['JavaScript','TypeScript','React','Next.js','Node.js','Supabase','PostgreSQL','WordPress','Elementor','WooCommerce','Google Search Console','GA4','Google Ads','GTM','Vercel','GitHub','Docker'].map(x=><span class="chip" style="padding:9px 14px">{x}</span>)}</div></div></section></Base>